121 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 60 0 R/T(Insight  Sales are not really spiky. They climbed steadily from $87K in 2019 to $2.48M in 2025, up 45% in 2024 and 48% in 2025. Q4 is the strongest stretch, running 16 to 18% above the yearly average from October to December. Growth comes mostly from new buyers, the order value stays near $86. Orders per buyer reached 1.12 in September 2026, an early sign of repeat buying. Suggestion :We can stock up for Q4 early.)/E(Insight  Sales are not really spiky. They climbed steadily from $87K in 2019 to $2.48M in 2025, up 45% in 2024 and 48% in 2025. Q4 is the strongest stretch, running 16 to 18% above the yearly average from October to December. Growth comes mostly from new buyers, the order value stays near $86. Orders per buyer reached 1.12 in September 2026, an early sign of repeat buying. Suggestion :We can stock up for Q4 early.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[53]>>
endobj

