<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 62 0 R/T(The Analysis :  The AVG\(retail_price\) OVER \(PARTITION BY category\) window function adds each category\220s average price to every product row. The query then calculates how far each product is from that average, uses IF to flag products above it, sorts by the difference and returns the top 20.)/E(The Analysis :  The AVG\(retail_price\) OVER \(PARTITION BY category\) window function adds each category\220s average price to every product row. The query then calculates how far each product is from that average, uses IF to flag products above it, sorts by the difference and returns the top 20.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[31]>>
endobj

186 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 62 0 R/T(Insight  Surprisingly, most of the products in this list \(14 out of 20\) have exactly the same price: $903. This looks strange because they are very different items, like socks, sports bras, and jackets. Maybe it is a data error, so I would check these products first.)/E(Insight  Surprisingly, most of the products in this list \(14 out of 20\) have exactly the same price: $903. This looks strange because they are very different items, like socks, sports bras, and jackets. Maybe it is a data error, so I would check these products first.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[32]>>
