698 0 obj
<</Title(Insight  Surprisingly, most of the products in this list \(14 out of 20\) have exactly the same price: $903. This looks strange because they are very different items, like socks, sports bras, and jackets. Maybe it is a data error, so I would check these products first.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 661 0 R/Prev 735 0 R>>
endobj

699 0 obj
<</Title(order_type)/Dest[14 0 R/Fit]/Parent 662 0 R/Next 736 0 R>>
endobj

700 0 obj
<</Title(Insight  First orders bring nearly 64% of sales \(80,131 orders, $6.9M\) and repeat orders 36% \($3.9M\). Average order value is almost identical \($86.26 vs $86.93\), so repeat customers do not spend more per order. They just come back, about 0.56 repeat orders per customer. Winning new customers matters most, and bundles or loyalty offers could lift repeat baskets.)/Dest[14 0 R/Fit]/Parent 662 0 R/Prev 737 0 R>>
endobj

