<</Title(count)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 602 0 R/Prev 663 0 R/Next 738 0 R>>
endobj

702 0 obj
<</Title(The Analysis :  Returned orders are grouped by product category. The return rate is the value of returned items divided by the category\220s total sales. Data comes from order_items, joined with orders for status and products for category.)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 602 0 R/Prev 739 0 R/Next 664 0 R>>
endobj

